## 1. Architecture & Layering Strategy (Clean / Hexagonal)

```
src/{module_kebab}/
├── cmd/
│   └── main.go                    # Application entrypoint & dependency injection wireup
├── internal/
│   ├── domain/                    # Pure domain logic (Zero external dependencies)
│   │   ├── {entity_snake}.go      # Aggregate Root, Entities & Invariant validation
│   │   ├── errors.go              # Domain error definitions
│   │   └── events.go              # Domain event payloads
│   ├── ports/                     # Inbound & Outbound Interfaces
│   │   ├── service.go             # Inbound primary application port
│   │   └── repository.go          # Outbound secondary storage port
│   ├── service/                   # Application Use Cases
│   │   ├── {entity_snake}_svc.go  # Use case orchestration & business transactions
│   │   └── {entity_snake}_test.go # Unit tests with mocked repositories
│   ├── adapters/                  # Secondary Infrastructure Adapters
│   │   └── postgres/              # Concrete database persistence
│   │       ├── repository.go      # SQL queries & connection pooling
│   │       └── repository_test.go # Integration tests with testcontainers
│   └── handlers/                  # Primary Ingress Adapters
│       └── http/                  # REST / HTTP router
│           ├── router.go          # Route declarations & middleware
│           ├── handler.go         # Request decoding, validation & response encoding
│           └── handler_test.go    # HTTP endpoint integration tests
└── tests/
    └── contract/                  # OpenAPI / Schema compatibility test suite
```

